        "parts" : [ {
          "name" : "overview",
          "prose" : "# Context\n\nThis section describes security controls applicable to wired networks and extends the ‘Network design and configuration’ section of these guidelines.\n\n# Further information\n\nFurther information on encrypting communications can be found in the ‘Cryptographic fundamentals’ section of the [Guidelines for cryptography](#195abe87-bb1e-4006-8b42-eaecca4d51f1).\n\nFurther information on 802.1X authentication and key exchange can be found in the ‘Network design and configuration’ section of these guidelines."
